VideoScience-Judge protocol adapter

This directory contains an adaptation of prompts and evaluation protocol from:
  VideoScience, Hao AI Lab
  https://github.com/hao-ai-lab/VideoScience
  commit 0b3bb2da74388991bf842bca1096a6a25d3c9311

The upstream work is licensed under the MIT License. The complete upstream
license text is preserved in LICENSE in this directory.

Ayase adaptations include strict JSON validation, explicit provenance and
input-mode metadata, and provider lifecycle/resource cleanup. The scorer is a
reusable VLM judge protocol; it is not a downloadable trained VideoScience model.
